chx:CQ1 a owl:NamedIndividual, rd:CompetencyQuestion ; rdfs:label "Which steps turn an image into text a program can trust, which of them can a program check for itself and which need a person, and what decides that?"@en .
chx:CQ2 a owl:NamedIndividual, rd:CompetencyQuestion ; rdfs:label "Which statements of the chapter differ in current tools or Python, and on what source?"@en .
